## Root .gitignore for ApplAi_Generator.
## Covers BOTH halves of this repo: the Vite/React/TypeScript client under
## VSC/client/src/ and the (not yet built, per DECISIONS.md ADR-011) ASP.NET
## Core backend under VSC/server/. Keep both sections up to date as each
## side grows — this file is the safety net; VSC/client/src/.gitignore
## covers client-specific dev tooling but this root file is what actually
## governs `git add` runs from the repo root or from VSC/client/.

# ============================================================
# Node.js / npm / Vite / TypeScript (client, any client/ subfolder)
# ============================================================
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
build/
coverage/
*.local
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnp/
.pnp.js
*.tsbuildinfo
e2e/test-results/
e2e/playwright-report/
playwright-report/
test-results/

# ============================================================
# .NET / ASP.NET Core (server, any server/ subfolder)
# A streamlined .gitignore for modern .NET projects including temporary
# files, build results, and files generated by popular .NET tools.
# Get latest from https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Dotnet.gitignore
# ============================================================

# Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][Ii][Nn]32/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# .NET Core
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

# ASP.NET Scaffolding
ScaffoldingReadMe.txt

# NuGet Packages
*.nupkg
# NuGet Symbol Packages
*.snupkg

# Others
~$*
*~
CodeCoverage/

# MSBuild Binary and Structured Log
*.binlog

# MSTest test Results
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*

# NUnit
*.VisualState.xml
TestResult.xml
nunit-*.xml

# ============================================================
# Cross-platform / editor / OS
# ============================================================
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
